---
description: Review combinations of names, dates, places and relationships for indirect speaker disclosure.
args: { dossier: OralHistoryDossier; change: ArchiveChange; accounts: OralHistoryAccount[]; references: OralHistoryReference[]; consent: ConsentSpan[] }
returns: string[]
---
Check each public quote and summary against the speaker's consent audience and restricted spans. Consider whether combined rare details identify the speaker even when direct names are removed. Require qualified review when privacy risk is uncertain. A public-safe summary must not reveal a withdrawn anecdote indirectly.
